# Whitelist .gitignore for a repo rooted at wp-content/ (docs/09).
# Ignore everything, then admit only what this repo owns.
# A fork that deploys also admits /.github/ and /wp-cli.yml (the starter has neither), and
# keeps this file in step with the rsync --exclude list in .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
# css.validate:false for Tailwind v4 at-rules — not personal prefs
!/.vscode/
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/docs/
# Personal apprenticeship evidence: never in the shared repo (David, 2026-11-06)
/docs/apprenticeship-log.md
!/scripts/

!/themes/
/themes/*
!/themes/mbf-blank/

!/plugins/
/plugins/*
# !/plugins/mbf-blank-core/     # whitelist our own plugins here

!/mu-plugins/
/mu-plugins/*
# Local-only MCP server (inert outside local/development; deploys copy the theme only)
!/mu-plugins/mbf-mcp.php

# Design handoff: keep the README brief, never the heavy binaries
/themes/mbf-blank/design_handoff/*
!/themes/mbf-blank/design_handoff/README.md

# Internal Made by Factory standards: never for clients. They load from each developer's
# own checkout via the theme CLAUDE.md import, so a copy in the project is always a mistake.
**/mbf-site-standards/

# Render fingerprints (docs/08): ~15MB of JSON per capture, never in git
**/.fingerprints/
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
# ...except a theme's unlayered plugin overrides (02: src/vendor/*.css). Without this,
# **/vendor/ (meant for Composer) silently keeps them out of git.
!**/src/vendor/
**/dist/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sql
**/*.sql.gz
CLAUDE.local.md
